{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>והצב</b> — I have not found for this word an interpretation more distinguished than the words of R. Shmuel ha-Nagid, for הצב is the name of the queen; therefore her attendants carried her in a palanquin to lead her into captivity, and her nurses who raised her are compared to the voice of doves in their moaning." "<b>מתופפות</b> — the way of the timbrel is to strike it with the hand."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:34.382088361Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}